        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Sydney Sixers (WBBL), Australian women's national soccer team, New South Wales Breakers\n- People: Ellyse Perry, Ashleigh Gardner\n- Places: Sydney, Australia\n- Events: inaugural Women's Big Bash League\n- Topics: women's cricket, Australian sport, band formation\n\nFacts:\n- In 2005, The Death Set formed in Sydney, Australia.\n- The inaugural Women's Big Bash League commenced in December 2015.\n- The Sydney Sixers WBBL team is a women's cricket team based in Sydney, Australia, and it competed in the inaugural Women's Big Bash League.\n- Ellyse Alexandra Perry, born on 3 November 1990, is an Australian sportswoman who debuted for both the Australian cricket team and the Australian women's national soccer team at age 16.\n- Ashleigh Gardner, born on 15 April 1997, is an Australian cricketer who plays for New South Wales Breakers in the Women's National Cricket League and for Sydney Sixers in the Women's Big Bash League.",
